òng ngay ngày hôm đó.\n\nTình trạng phòng và giá có thể đổi theo đơn mới, phòng đang giữ chỗ và các quy tắc điều chỉnh giá theo ngày. Pico phải gọi công cụ trực tiếp để nêu giá và phòng trống. Với câu hỏi thiếu ngày hoặc số khách, hỏi đúng thông tin còn thiếu bằng một câu ngắn. Báo giá trong chat chỉ để tham khảo tại thời điểm tra cứu; khách cần kiểm tra và xác nhận trên trang đặt phòng.','7e501b9768abcf802c867e4acf40a726098f5d41f43218f957d22e47b05f00cf','[-0.024844043,-0.0012758166,-0.012428225,-0.051696256,0.0052902875,0.014249421,-0.024807673,0.004841452,-0.019042498,-0.02261295,0.0008360015,0.0038728674,-0.002954378,0.0014441888,0.14027897,0.007546187,0.016153432,0.032181814,-0.008876145,0.023222446,-0.0041159545,0.021283107,0.001622162,-0.0017981754,-0.00069095683,0.00969545,-0.009130927,0.018799,0.030541984,-0.0041828305,0.011546098,-0.000052283853,-0.0055029485,0.0004412078,0.004542044,0.009513443,0.0032453332,-0.005830602,0.0011000396,0.017896285,0.0019098052,-0.0023890678,-0.032027043,-0.019625101,-0.0047086123,-0.011446981,0.00021699474,-0.027909692,0.018204525,0.03545035,-0.0063456153,0.0132761635,-0.01690921,-0.19550087,0.0056701303,-0.027005134,0.019507043,0.020142388,-0.016907148,-0.037475944,-0.010222144,0.017210703,-0.005951833,-0.006561862,-0.0015162326,0.021901377,0.027388874,0.018807376,0.013455569,-0.013172634,0.020547787,-0.0006055343,-0.0029118434,-0.01804931,0.006859679,-0.017514937,-0.008368373,0.021155553,-0.003265866,0.00631961,0.010020212,-0.022396682,-0.0039314805,-0.025958763,0.023944559,-0.017351178,0.017792827,0.021588182,-0.029088566,0.005395246,-0.015566423,0.028904926,0.021212777,0.0016593529,0.005064438,0.012932896,0.016743425,0.0056160977,-0.040312916,-0.010676394,-0.004578234,-0.006104048,0.004097241,-0.0008375334,0.025389876,-0.007402989,0.009280499,0.014177856,-0.028427381,0.0004503622,0.0058730827,-0.0113164885,0.0056619076,0.010001616,-0.005582892,-0.1384196,0.004099058,-0.0015269727,-0.0046070456,0.0022267818,-0.018956348,0.