tiền có thể hoàn không vượt tổng tiền đơn hoặc khoản đã thu thành công. Khi hủy đủ điều kiện, yêu cầu hoàn tiền được ghi nhận để lễ tân xác nhận sau khi xử lý với cổng thanh toán; việc hủy đơn không đồng nghĩa tiền đã về tài khoản ngay. Pico không tự xác nhận khách chắc chắn được hoàn bao nhiêu nếu chưa xem đơn cụ thể, và không thực hiện hoàn tiền.','38404261652168c0324e75b47572692d002bf8a7bee57e50137014e08e877e4d','[-0.00033871428,0.0130720325,-0.00773001,-0.04829909,-0.003828786,-0.008158092,-0.033904642,0.011146978,-0.014226314,-0.046987224,0.0022128585,0.02109587,-0.0007814343,-0.010663419,0.12081279,0.0021136692,0.010543202,0.024053155,-0.024615895,0.02087779,0.012006652,0.015215939,-0.009482208,0.0062493384,0.009203199,0.006093837,0.0034396518,0.02911184,0.03533867,0.013390993,-0.0035687494,-0.016524138,-0.0150917685,-0.003200649,0.008522833,0.011104824,0.019008314,0.0045462274,-0.017286198,0.02939785,-0.032139216,0.0058798436,-0.023345504,0.00987243,0.0063666347,-0.021594424,-0.00077838264,-0.021148337,0.004902551,0.03763842,0.026473694,-0.013012975,-0.01156637,-0.18939243,0.004562773,0.008720844,0.0029552316,0.011901841,-0.014792631,-0.032017075,-0.024702746,0.02490769,0.0025162431,-0.0043005194,-0.0050992514,0.040780637,0.016231863,0.026924424,-0.0004997301,-0.0020809027,0.007332424,0.007534378,0.020403385,-0.022659086,-0.009960024,-0.0070503484,0.007480634,0.041176103,0.017588997,-0.0015378527,0.017680032,-0.026008958,-0.008212183,-0.027435021,0.019187922,-0.019648746,0.0059816623,0.009899346,0.009931217,-0.0038894154,0.019481394,-0.011159099,0.028626459,-0.019994091,-0.01587546,0.021234479,-0.0070131626,0.009066422,-0.03040811,-0.0010633887,-0.010926374,0.0017255651,-0.0025086256,-0.01458318,0.0071971435,-0.026419718,0.031364486,0.004457018,0.0015993821,-0.020702036,0.0024689522,-0.004441685,0.008425425,0.0075134137,-0.015236655,-0.1385799,0.016503723,-0.015588532,-0.018085161,-0.027730633,-0.0049420344,-0.0020709378,0.0020874948,0.010836877,-0.018707627,